{"id":8859738505415,"title":"Personalized Celtic Yggdrasil Tree of Life Quilt Sets, Bedroom Decor","handle":"personalized-celtic-yggdrasil-tree-of-life-quilt-sets-bedroom-decor","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the enchanting Jeminise Celtic Tree of Life Quilt Set, featuring the Yggdrasil design—a powerful symbol of resilience and interconnectedness. This beautiful quilt set combines artistic charm with cozy comfort, making it a thoughtful gift for loved ones or a perfect addition to your home decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Showcases the amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life, symbolizing strength, growth, and family bonds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly suit your needs.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal present for moms, dads, sisters, brothers, grandparents, wives, husbands, sons, daughters, and other beloved family members for various occasions.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Functional and decorative for use on a bed, sofa, or couch, providing warmth for indoor and outdoor activities like camping and picnics.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water, dries quickly, and maintains its fluffiness, ideally in a mesh laundry bag.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes with 1 Quilt, with optional pillowcase(s) for a complete bedding experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from a blend of Polycotton, Cotton, and Polyester for a smooth and comfortable feel.\